{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling top-down  Action RPG where epic battles, strategic gameplay, and dynamic environments come together to create a constant stream of emergent experiences. Whether you\u2019re teaming up with friends or facing the dangers alone, the world of Vaultbreakers offers endless excitement, challenges, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5b23740ce6fbbef79187946171d69c9b.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on tense compact missions that dynamically unfold based on other players and NPC actions. Someone may pollute a big area, another may unlock a secret cave, and one may start an ancient ritual. Everyone has their own plans, ensuring each session is filled with threats and opportunities for you to grab or avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/4fd00178cf96dac055345220a6a86975.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changelings are an evil, chaotic, and unpredictable faction of shapeshifters who are swarming the Dragonvault. They are controlled by advanced AI or even other players, which makes them extremely unpredictable. You will constantly make exciting decisions on whether to avoid, assault, or even briefly team up with them to best achieve your own plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/23fd55b6916edb89500671e535f679aa.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill is everything. Attacks are punishing, but can all be avoided. Enemies are vulnerable when attacking, enabling you to deal double damage if you time it just right. However, not all fights are wise to engage in, and you\u2019ll always have to think twice before taking risky actions. From tense exploration where ambushes can happen around every corner to epic multi-group fights, you will always have to think on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/2da445af6f77cb793788164541a7160f.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaultbreakers offers many ways to progress and customize exactly to your liking and playstyle. You choose between various Champions, unlock and equip varied perks to alter their abilities, loot -or craft- items to boost your power, obtain new abilities, and awaken Artifacts to uncover unique passive powers. With these, you grow stronger or even learn abilities that help you traverse the world in new ways, like vaulting across the environment on plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/374b6026bea3b4ee63557f57e7cd9dd3.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a champion of the Vaultguard, an order dedicated to protecting the world from ancient, dark forces that threaten to rise once more. Immerse yourself in the lore-rich universe, interact with varied NPCs that send you on all manner of quests, and discover the world as you work your way toward the Dragonvault. Keep coming back for the competitive player ranking and climb the leaderboard by completing an endless variety of competitive challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/306910?t=1766064413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766064413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/20940ad97ae0f5b60ad3ed84a306ff0dcd9294bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766064413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/20940ad97ae0f5b60ad3ed84a306ff0dcd9294bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766064413","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>GET YOUR KEY - JOIN THE PLAYTEST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your key by visiting  (or click on the link on the information panel on the right). Join the Playtest, get Legacy Points, and share your feedback!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/9e306fe89e7e15c1427efadd1495a7df.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/9e306fe89e7e15c1427efadd1495a7df.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/9e306fe89e7e15c1427efadd1495a7df.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling top-down  Action RPG where epic battles, strategic gameplay, and dynamic environments come together to create a constant stream of emergent experiences. Whether you\u2019re teaming up with friends or facing the dangers alone, the world of Vaultbreakers offers endless excitement, challenges, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5b23740ce6fbbef79187946171d69c9b.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on tense compact missions that dynamically unfold based on other players and NPC actions. Someone may pollute a big area, another may unlock a secret cave, and one may start an ancient ritual. Everyone has their own plans, ensuring each session is filled with threats and opportunities for you to grab or avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.poster.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.webm?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/6e06ac0a993bc1edd559dfcc3385096d.mp4?t=1766064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/4fd00178cf96dac055345220a6a86975.avif?t=1766064413\" width=600 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changelings are an evil, chaotic, and unpredictable faction of shapeshifters who are swarming the Dragonvault. They are controlled by advanced AI or even other players, which makes them extremely unpredictable. You will constantly make exciting decisions on whether to avoid, assault, or even briefly team up with them to best achieve your own plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea